{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A top-down shooter game with cell-shaded graphics and a lot of fungus monsters set in a lab facility where an experiment, which was meant to be a breakthrough in biological enhancement, has gone wrong and unleashed a plague of <strong>half-dead fungi monsters</strong> hungry for blood. Fight through hordes of fungus demons as a special soldier sent to investigate the cause. Wield powerful weapons and abilities, use items like serums and freeze guns<strong>,\u00a0</strong>fight them off, clear the lab, while exploring endless corridors filled with explosives.<br>The facility\u2019s <strong>dynamic alarming system</strong> constantly monitors your actions. Survive quietly, and you might make it through unnoticed. Causes too much destruction, and the entire lab shifts into <strong>high alert</strong>, flooding areas with stronger, faster enemies and unpredictable ambushes. Every decision you make affects the <strong>intensity and rhythm</strong> of survival.</h2>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Survive level 1","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4075890/7ae56a6bfad8be807e34bdab2b1e66ad47d79441.jpg"},{"name":"Survive level 2","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4075890/7ae56a6bfad8be807e34bdab2b1e66ad47d79441.jpg"},{"name":"Survive level 3","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4075890/7ae56a6bfad8be807e34bdab2b1e66ad47d79441.jpg"},{"name":"Survive level 4","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4075890/7ae56a6bfad8be807e34bdab2b1e66ad47d79441.jpg"},{"name":"Survive level 5","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4075890/7ae56a6bfad8be807e34bdab2b1e66ad47d79441.jpg"},{"name":"Survive level 6","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4075890/7ae56a6bfad8be807e34bdab2b1e66ad47d79441.jpg"},{"na